      "title": "Update (07/25/2024)",
      "date": "2024-07-25 07:37:14",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5963413094348015956",
      "content": "Statistics and achievement overview are now available. You can access the stats via the main menu and the item menu.\n\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3296010334][img]https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3296010334[/img][/url]",
      "key": "2526080::80b54654668d99fa279288408a8664124a8f51b4",
      "tags": null
    },
    {
      "title": "Update (06/15/2024)",
      "date": "2024-06-15 09:49:52",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6890025005356301570",
      "content": "- It is now easier to lift objects. You don't have to \"pull\" them to your direction to lift them up. Just a button press now.\n- Some more hints implemented in the beginning section.\n- fixed an issue with the italian language file.\n- You can now highlight the area you need to go to next. To activate this, go into the item menu, then go to the quest log dialogue, with a press on the X button you can highlight the area and switch to the worldmap.\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/802681f58f8dfbc0cef058a1994da251da789014.jpg[/img]",
      "key": "2526080::dcb53ae28670ad488ef7be455e1601ea74309237",
      "tags": null
    },
    {
      "title": "Huge graphic overhaul for Juna - The Dreamwalker",
      "date": "2024-06-10 06:23:43",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5746109972563020334",
      "content": "[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/ec164bc5679b2b95be4d6bfd6cbedd155e8ad06e.jpg[/img]\n[h1]Big Update: Massive Graphic Overhaul Now Live!\n[/h1]\nWe are thrilled to announce our latest update, delivering a comprehensive graphical overhaul to enhance your gaming experience! This update is packed with significant visual improvements, performance optimizations, and crucial bug fixes.\n\n[h2]Enhanced New Graphics[/h2]\nEvery aspect of the game has been meticulously redrawn, from the main menu to the end credits. Immerse yourself in a beautifully refreshed world with vibrant colors and sharper details.\n\nWith this update, you now have the option to switch from the classic 16-pixel tile graphics to 32-pixel tile graphics. This new option doubles the resolution of in-game tiles, offering a richer and more detailed visual experience.\nCheck out the comparison images below:\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/d5cfc119cc9955122f9cb447049991d221f67d40.png[/img]\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/626803ea114281b907cd44e7a11416e08305677d.png[/img]\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/331f51833bb1dcf7fc1370cdafbe25525e793908.png[/img]\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/6db833fe5bac1207706693e9518b16cd3ca38c88.png[/img]\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/90cb3d6baf89c2ecf980de009620c0e643a86fbb.png[/img]\n\n[h2]Performance Optimizations[/h2]\nWe\u2019ve made several under-the-hood improvements to ensure smoother gameplay. Enjoy faster load times, reduced lag, and a more responsive experience overall.\n\n[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]\nThis update addresses numerous bugs reported by our community. Key fixes include:\n- Resolved an issue where the game would crash during certain scenes.\n- Fixed graphical glitches that occurred on specific occasions.\n- Memory usage halved\n\nThank you for your continued support and feedback. We hope you enjoy this massive update and look forward to hearing your thoughts. Dive back into the game and experience the new visuals today!\n\n[b]Update your game now and see the difference![/b]",
      "key": "2526080::5ff82801ce0bb4269d025d78e550b9fdd2c87a7e",
      "tags": null
    },
